UID:10003238-1786791600-1786793400@lancastersciencefactory.org
SUMMARY:Sea Sparkle Slime Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a 30-minute facilitated workshop where participants will create their own  blue sparkly slime while discovering how a few simple ingredients come together to create this stretchy\, squishy favorite. Workshops will take place at 11:00am and 1:00pm\, so choose the time that works best for you! \nCustomize your slime with festive glitter and special sea creature charms! \nRequired Age: 6+\nWorkshop Fee: $9 per participant\nCapacity: 24 participants per session \nPlease Note: A paid workshop ticket is required for each participant. Purchase your tickets here! \nAdmission is required and Workshop fees are separate from admission and are not included with any admission type or program. Please plan to either purchase timed entry tickets\, purchase tickets at the door\, or use one of our free admission programs. \nAdvance registration is recommended\, as space is limited to 24 participants per session. \nMembers: don’t forget to sign in to get your 10% member discount!
URL:https://lancastersciencefactory.org/event/sea-sparkle-slime-workshop/2026-08-15/1/
LOCATION:The Lancaster Science Factory\, 454 New Holland Ave\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://lancastersciencefactory.org/wp-content/uploads/Sea-Sparkle-Slime-Workshop-1920-x-1080-px.png
GEO:40.0461822;-76.2963319
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The Lancaster Science Factory 454 New Holland Ave Lancaster PA 17602 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=454 New Holland Ave:geo:-76.2963319,40.0461822
END:VEVENT
