UID:10003241-1794076200-1794126600@lancastersciencefactory.org
SUMMARY:Night Shift at Lancaster Science Factory
DESCRIPTION:Night Shift 2026-27  \nOverview: Experience the Lancaster Science Factory in a whole new way when you stay overnight! Explore over 75 hands-on exhibits\, enjoy a pre-lights-out snack\, unroll your sleeping bag in the exhibit hall\, and have a light breakfast before you leave in the morning. New to this year\, educators will be leading hands-on STEM workshops in our Maker Space! Consider joining us for the Night Shift with your scout group\, sports team or even for a special birthday!  \nTickets: Tickets for the Night Shift are just $65 and include activity guides\, a hands-on STEM workshop\, snacks\, and breakfast. This program is limited to children ages 6-12 and one adult (18+) is required for every three children. No adults will be admitted without children.   \nDates:  \nSaturday\, November 7-Sunday\, November 8\, 2026  \n\nClick here to register \n\nSaturday\, December 5-Sunday\, December 6\, 2026  \n\nClick here to register \n\nSaturday\, February 13-Sunday\, February 14\, 2027  \n\nClick here to register \n\nSaturday\, April 17-Sunday\, April 18\, 2027  \n\nClick here to register \n\nItinerary:  \n\n6:30-7:00 pm: Arrival\, check in \n\n\n7:00-10:00 pm: Museum exploration\, Science Cafe activity\, scavenger hunts\, workshops \n\n\n7:15-7:55: Group A workshop \n\n\n8:05-8:45: Group B workshop \n\n\n8:55-9:25: Group C workshop \n\n\n10:00-10:30 pm: Set up sleeping accommodations \n\n\n10:30 pm: Get ready for lights out \n\n\n7:00-8:00 am: Light breakfast available \n\n\n8:30 am: Exhibit hall closes \n\nQuestions? Reach out to mstoltzfus@tlsf.org
URL:https://lancastersciencefactory.org/event/night-shift-at-lancaster-science-factory/2026-11-07/
LOCATION:The Lancaster Science Factory\, 454 New Holland Ave\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://lancastersciencefactory.org/wp-content/uploads/Night-Shift.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Megan Stoltzfus":MAILTO:mstoltzfus@tlsf.org
GEO:40.0461822;-76.2963319
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The Lancaster Science Factory 454 New Holland Ave Lancaster PA 17602 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=454 New Holland Ave:geo:-76.2963319,40.0461822
END:VEVENT
